Engineering-geological surveys should provide a comprehensive study of the current state of  the engineering-geological  conditions  of  the  territory  (region,  site,  route)  planned  for  construction development, assessment and forecasting of possible changes in these conditions when using it. The survey program should provide for the performance of engineering and geological surveys, including a set of  individual types of  survey work.

