«Completion  of pre-commissioning  works»  means  the  completion  of the  Facilities/Works (excluding deficiencies in any item of  the Defect list ofD category) and that the permanent Items meet the requirements of  all stages and tests set out in this section, and also meet all legal requirements and requirements  for issuance  The  Act  of completion  of commissioning  works  in  accordance  with  the Contract.
«Mechanical readiness» means the completion of  the Facilities /Works (excluding deficiencies in any item of  the Defect list of  C category and on the items of  the Defect list of  D category), including mechanical readiness checks and tests on the Items to demonstrate that the Facilities /Works comply with  the  requirements  of the  Contract  and  construction  documentation,  as  well  as  readiness  for commissioning in a safe mode.
«Defect list» means a list of  works that have not been completed and that must be continuously performed,  corrected,  adjusted  or  repaired  by  the  Contractor  at  its  own expense  as  a  condition for obtaining the Acceptance certificate in accordance with the Contract.
«Items of  the Defect list» means all items of  the Defect list that are part of  the Facilities/Works, determined (periodically) during any inspection of  the Facilities/Works as not complying with the terms of  the Contract and as defined in this section, which are divided into the following categories:
1. «Items  of the  Defect  list  of A  category»  means  work  that  must  be  corrected  prior  to hydraulic/electrical testing;
2. «Items of  the Defect list of  B category» means works that must be corrected to Mechanical readiness;
3. «Items  of the  Defect  list  of C  category»  means  works  that  must  be  corrected  prior  to Completion of  pre-commissioning works;
