4. «Items of  the Defect list of  D category» means minor outstanding issues that:
2. -will  not  affect  the  reliability,  non-failure  operation,  functionality,  safety,  compliance  with current legislation, as well as the mechanical and structural integrity of  objects;
- will not affect the performance of  tests upon completion of  construction;
- will not affect the use of  the facilities for their intended purpose (  either until or until these issues are resolved);
